# User and agent state: never tracked, never touched by updates.
pikkumies/local/
# Hermes: the vanilla checkout, trees a failed build left (moved aside, never deleted), the ready
# marker and the build lock (ADR-0033).
pikkumies/hermes/
pikkumies/hermes.broken-*/
pikkumies/include/.hermes-ready
pikkumies/include/.hermes-build.lock
pikkumies/memory/*
!pikkumies/memory/README.md
/vendor/
*.log
# Generated at install, update and run (ADR-0015, ADR-0030); never tracked.
pikkumies/tools/INDEX.md
pikkumies/hooks/INDEX.md
